.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-256kj1/TASK-260720-256kj1_final-review-verdict.md:9:The implementation matches the task scope and acceptance criteria. The new internal/buildsource package implements the exact curator-build-source-v1 domain prefix and uint64 big-endian framing, unsigned UTF-8 path ordering, root .csk-install.json inclusion, portable and platform-collision validation, link and special-file rejection, and a retained-root token with before/after rechecks. Directory structure participates in frozen-state equivalence without changing the file-only protocol digest. internal/hashing has no diff, preserving legacy marker-excluding ContentSHA256 behavior.
